  "content": "UNITED STATES\nSECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION\nWashington, D.C. 20549\n\nFORM 10-K\nANNUAL REPORT PURSUANT TO SECTION 13 OR 15(d) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934\n\nFor the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023\n\nMeta Platforms, Inc.\nTicker Symbol: META\n\nPART I\n\nItem 1. Business\nMeta Platforms, Inc. is a leading company in its industry sector.\n\nItem 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis\n\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS FOR 2023:\nRevenue: $134,902 million\nOperating Income: $33,725 million  \nNet Income: $39,098 million\nTotal Assets: $229,100 million\n\nCONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME\n(In millions)\n\nYear Ended December 31, 2023\n\nRevenue                 $134,902\nCost of Revenue         $80,941\nGross Profit           $53,960\nOperating Income        $33,725\nNet Income             $39,098\n\nCONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEET\n(In millions)\n\nTotal Assets           $229,100\nTotal Liabilities      $91,640\nStockholders' Equity   $137,460"
